    "detailed_description": "EQUAL PEOPLE<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the City of Neapolis.<br />\r\nYou are here to solve a Mystery.<br />\r\nTalk to People and Get Clues.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo on Quests and Side-Missions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game Text and Voices are Generated by Artificial Intelligence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe City is Procedurally Generated.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo Move around Quicker, You can Drive the 'Parked' Cars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is also a Parkour Mini-Game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game uses the GPU Melting Power of Unreal Engine 5.1 to generate Hyper Photorealistic People and Environments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-------------------------------<br />\r\n*** Challenges ***<br />\r\n&quot;Easter Egg&quot; Challenge - How many Archor Games Related Items Appear in the Game ?<br />\r\n&quot;Speed Run&quot; Challenge - What is the Fastest Time You can finish ?<br />\r\n&quot;Scenic&quot; Pictures Challenge - Take Screenshots of the Beautiful Area and share them on Social Media with Your Friends.<br />\r\n&quot;Walkthrough&quot; Challenge - Post a video of a Complete 'Walkthrough' of the entire Game.<br />\r\nWalk Don't Run Challenge - Only Walk (No Sprinting) and No &quot;High/Sprint&quot; Jumps for the Entire Game and Post Your Full Video online.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Steamy Streamer&quot; Challenge - Get ALL of the Archor Games products available on Steam and Stream ALL of them Beginning to End.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;IRL ARG&quot; Challenge - This game and other ARCHOR GAMES are part of an &quot;Alternate Reality Game&quot; &quot;In Real Life&quot; Challenge, be sure to check out ALL of our games for Clues to the Mystery.",
